│ patch_type               │ fix                                                                                       │
│ patch_name               │ robust_vol_threshold_logic                                                                │
│ patch_description        │ The previous program likely failed due to the 'numpy' and 'math' imports being outside    │
│                          │ the EVOLVE-BLOCK, causing it to be undefined when the block is extracted for evaluation.  │
│                          │ This fix moves the imports inside the block, adds robust handling for NaN/infinite        │
